{"symbol":"OLATECH","yahoo":"OLATECH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Olatech Solutions Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.olatechs.com","about":"Olatech Solutions Limited provides data centre, enterprise, telecom, and information technology software solutions in the operations support system and business support system segments in India. The company offers software solutions, such as NOC tools, network monitoring, management and analytics, secured authentication and accounting of users and devices, data centre infrastructure management, etc. It offers Epiphany AAA software solution, which supports multiple authentication methods; Epiphany Billing, a carrier-grade convergent billing system; Epiphany DDI, a DNS-DHCP-IPAM solution; Log Management System, a web console to view, search, and filter syslog messages; Epiphany Network Monitoring System; IT Service Management services; Epiphany DCIM, a hybrid infrastructure management platform; and Epiphany Wi-Fi subscriber platform or Wi-Fi service management platform solution that helps to build personalized engagement platform. It also provides system integration, consultation, architecture, solution design, implementation, monitoring, as well as managed services. In addition, the company offers software development; cloud management; and application managed services, as well as AMC services, and hardware and software. Further, the company provides digital marketing services, search engine optimization, search engine marketing, social media marketing, e-commerce design and development, media buying, and web design and development. Olatech Solutions Limited was incorporated in 2014 and is headquartered in Navi Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:45:33+00:00","quote":{"price":62.5,"prevClose":65.74,"marketCap":27.82,"high52":290.9,"low52":58.0,"pe":16.49,"bookValue":44.57,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":8.9,"shares":0.4451,"insiders":77.2,"institutions":0.0},"p